<section class="prose">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    Urban Exposed is a personal archive of abandoned places I've explored and
    photographed — hospitals, factories, homes, and everything in between
    that's been left behind.
  </p>
  <p>
    I keep exact locations vague on purpose. These places are often
    structurally unsafe, sometimes legally off-limits, and easily damaged by
    vandalism or overcrowding once word gets out. Sharing the photos and the
    stories without the pin drop is how I keep exploring them, and how they
    stay standing a little longer.
  </p>
  <p>
    Thanks for looking.
  </p>
</section>
